# device data that must never be committed: the phone's DTB lives in ../private, Qualcomm firmware and partition
# dumps (IMEI/ICCID, EFS) stay off every repo. Not *.img/*.bin: Symbian test fixtures under kerneltest/ use them.
*.dtb
*.dtbo
*.mbn
*.mdt
*.[bB][0-9][0-9]
*.dump
dumps/

